        "eng": "A millennium ago, the divine general Fei Peng was exiled to the mortal realm after a legendary battle with the demon lord Chonglou. In the present, his reincarnation, Jing Tian, recovers a demonic sword as the Demon-Sealing Tower begins to tremble. Alongside companions Tang Xuejian, Xu Changqing, and Zi Xuan, he embarks on a quest to collect the Five Elemental Pearls, reseal the tower, and fulfill his ancient destiny.",
